// Asura Strike / Guillotine Fist (MO_EXTREMITYFIST) - authored STR-style effect.
//
// Convention (see redemptio.strfx.ron / systems.rs): offset & quad in STR pixels,
// anchor at (319, 291) on the victim, STR_WORLD_SCALE 0.2, smaller offset.y =
// higher; fps 30, linear key lerp; Add = additive.
//
// The Monk's signature finisher, matching the classic client: the six kanji of
// the skill's name (asura1-6.tga, the crisp glyphs; asura11-16.tga, their smoky
// glow variants layered behind) flash on one by one in an arc over the victim,
// then surge into the impact point and wink out (~34f @ 30fps). As the glyphs
// slam in, a white-gold flash and twenty long hit lines burst off the victim
// (the reference EF_TEIHIT1X hit), fading by ~1.4s. The quake is the
// descriptor's `shake`.
(
    fps: 30,
    layers: [
        // -- Kanji arc: glow variants behind each crisp glyph, warm gold. --
        (
            textures: ["ro://data/texture/effect/asura11.tga"],
            blend: Add,
            keys: [
                ( at: 0,  offset: (169.0, 235.0), quad: (45.0, 45.0),   color: (255, 205, 120, 0) ),
